CrateBeneath=/CrateBeneathIsMoney= building death drops (AfterDestruction tail).

The 14 retail city/tech ids (12 typed Money, CARUS07/CARUS17 random)
drop a crate at the origin cell when tombstoned: typed Money with
CrateBeneathIsMoney=, else a random draw. Tombstone-time, not kill time
(deterministic within our frame order); sold buildings never drop (retail
sell skips AfterDestruction). Runs on the crate-system switch (lobby
Crates / campaign), like ambient crates. Save format 73. Tests in
test_crate.cpp (money + random + control drops, determinism lock-in,
sold exclusion).

